---
description: >-
  Comments and directives inside a venn body, as the highlighters colour them
  (#498): a comment line, a comment after a statement, a directive line, and
  several statements on one line, which v12 parses.
---
venn-beta
  %% a comment line
  %%{init: {"venn": {"padding": 10}}}%%
  set A %% after a set
  set "B b" set C
  union A,"B b" union A,C
  style A stroke-width: 2 px, fill-opacity: "0.3"
